# .codebaseignore — keep AI code-context focused on the *app*, not on the 25k skill/rule files
#
# The 6 installed skill/rule repos under .skills-repos/ collectively contain
# ~24,889 files / ~11,519 dirs. Trae's Grep/SearchCodebase/experience scans, and
# downstream AI context builders, should NOT by-default walk these, because:
#   1) they are prompt-engineering rules, not application code;
#   2) their sheer size would swamp app-code context and slow every search;
#   3) they are consulted explicitly via .skills-repos/skills-installed.json
#      priority paths only when the user's task matches a SKILL.md / rule.
#
# Any future tooling that honors .codebaseignore semantics should skip patterns
# below. If a tool does NOT honor this file, apply equivalent exclusions at the
# tool boundary (e.g. Grep path prefix = app source folders only, SearchCodebase
# target_directories = [components|app|lib|…]).

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1) The whole skills folder tree is rules, not application code.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.skills-repos/

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2) Usual node-level noise (defense in depth — some skill repos ship these
#    and we never want them in app-code context even outside .skills-repos).
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
dist/
build/
.next/
.nuxt/
.turbo/
.cache/
.parcel-cache/

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3) Lockfiles / binaries / large serialized outputs in ANY folder.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
pnpm-lock.yaml
package-lock.json
yarn.lock
bun.lockb
*.log
*.sqlite
*.db
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.ico
*.woff
*.woff2
*.ttf
*.eot
*.otf
*.mp4
*.mp3
*.wav
*.zip
*.tar
*.gz
*.tgz

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 4) Tooling config / test snapshots we do NOT need to reason about app code.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
coverage/
.nyc_output/
snapshots/
__snapshots__/
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
